[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5222.55, "timestamp": "01:27:02", "text": "现在我们得添加一些文字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5234.55, "timestamp": "01:27:14", "text": "Glo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5243.51, "timestamp": "01:27:23", "text": "好了。那就是你化身为一条鱼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5268.629, "timestamp": "01:27:48", "text": "所以对于眼睛来说，你想做的就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5270.87, "timestamp": "01:27:50", "text": "你通常想要的就像，如果你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5275.91, "timestamp": "01:27:55", "text": "说实话，你不需要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5277.91, "timestamp": "01:27:57", "text": "给它们涂上颜色。你可以只涂一种颜色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5279.99, "timestamp": "01:27:59", "text": "就像一个黑点，然后加上“就像”"}]